  "notes_after": [
    "Note. Values are adjusted marginal-mean contrasts for high versus low EVI from cross-sectional baseline (2011) models (they accompany the adjusted-means figure of the previous manuscript version; the current Figure 2c,d shows observed distributions). Negative differences indicate younger BA or lower BAA in the high-EVI group. Abbreviations: BA, biological age; BAA, biological age acceleration; EVI, enhanced vegetation index; O₃, ozone."
